I used to think tourists are the hardest class to ascend, but after
having ascended one, I discovered that actually they are quite easy once
you get past the initial game. The initial game is tough because you
start out with lousy armor, lousy weapons, and lousy stats, and
basically have to play blind-and-hide with the camera. But once you
start getting decent armor and improve your weapon skills, your survival
chances dramatically increase. And once you get the Quest artifact, the
game becomes significantly easier. (I wouldn't say it gets *easy*, but
it's definitely no worse than any other class by that point, and
arguably easier than many classes.)


